&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Arionkoder is an AI consulting firm helping companies build, embed, and own AI systems that drive real business outcomes. We combine Product Development, Artificial Intelligence, and Team Augmentation to craft digital products and solutions that create lasting impact — guided by a human-centric approach and a commitment to pushing the boundaries of what technology can do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We’re hiring a contract AI engineer with a backend or full stack background who builds, deploys and operates AI agents in production, using leading-edge agentic development practice to ship quickly. Our client builds AI agents and products for the trucking and fleet compliance space, used by both its customers and its internal teams. Agents work across tolling and millions of compliance documents, on top of more than 10 years of toll, inspection, safety and vehicle data. What you ship affects revenue, safety and compliance directly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design, build and deploy AI agents end to end, from first spec to production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ship early and iterate on feedback from real users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work with product, support and engineering stakeholders to turn loose problems into clear requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the infrastructure and delivery path of the agents you build: infrastructure as code, CI/CD and deployment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own what you ship once it’s live: monitoring, evals, cost and failure handling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Help the team move faster by bringing in and spreading best practices in agentic engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll work:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Use coding agents as your main way of building software: define the work, check what agents produce and make the calls that matter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Break work into pieces an agent can finish and you can verify, and run several agents in parallel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Rely on tests, CI and agent review so speed doesn’t cost quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;When something goes wrong, improve your setup so it doesn’t happen again, and package what works as reusable skills for the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Backend or full stack engineering background, with recent hands-on AI engineering experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A track record of shipping agents and AI features to production, with users who rely on them today.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You own the full path to production yourself: infrastructure as code (Terraform), CI/CD, deployment and monitoring.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cloud experience in AWS and/or Azure, including container orchestrators (Kubernetes or ECS/Azure .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You use evals and data to decide when an agent is ready to ship and to measure whether it’s succeeding once live.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong Python or TypeScript, with experience building with LLM APIs and MCP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with agent frameworks or SDKs, and knowing when not to use one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You already use coding agents as your main way of building software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You work independently, gather requirements from non-engineering stakeholders and give specific answers. When you don’t know something, you say so.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Advanced English, written and oral.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Frontend experience on existing production platforms.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Databricks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;LLM observability and eval tools.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Background in logistics, transportation or compliance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Notes: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Interviews are hands-on: expect to walk through something you’ve built and shipped, in detail.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Remote, LATAM · Overlap with 9am–5pm US Eastern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;💵 Monthly USD Service Fee&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;🌴 20 business days of paid Agreed Time Off—Annual + 6 Local Holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;x19la9d6 x1fc57z9 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x19co3pv x1g5zs5t xfibh0p xiy17q3 x1xsqp64 x1lkfr7t xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd&quot; style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;xrtxmta x1bhl96m&quot;&gt;🐣Caregiver Time Off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;x19la9d6 x1fc57z9 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x19co3pv x1g5zs5t xfibh0p xiy17q3 x1xsqp64 x1lkfr7t xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;xrtxmta x1bhl96m&quot;&gt;💻&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;A dynamic remote work culture. You can work from anywhere!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;🚀An entrepreneurial environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;In 2010, our founders dreamed up a company that could positively impact the world. Since then, we&#39;ve been in permanent evolution: from business consulting to innovation and design, and now to building amazing digital products powered by AI. We scaled globally, launched AI Labs and Reshape Studios, and claimed our space as an AI consulting firm — helping organizations move from pilots to production through accountable AI. Today, we&#39;re expanding our impact across industries, driving real AI adoption through accountability, governance, and value at scale. Dreamers first, builders always.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
